# Memory

- Before big work: read `.cursor/memory/MEMORY.md`, then topic files under `.cursor/memory/<topic>/`.
- Store reusable lessons (problem, fix, why, when to reuse); user-requested items always saved.
- New topic → new folder + link from `MEMORY.md`. Keep entries short and searchable.
